    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9196" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνολβ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		poet. Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unblest, wretched, luckless,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦμαρ</span> Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.85
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαῖα, ὄμμα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				247
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IA</u>
				354
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤμοι ἐμῶν ἄνολβα
			βουλευμάτων,</span> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμὰ . .
				βουλεύματα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1265
			</span></i>: of persons, <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				288
			</span></i>(
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				551
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1156
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>without means, poor,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				1073
			</span></i>.</div>
